Comments and steering.machineDiagnoses below as steering. This is a stateless reconcile attempt: inspect and preserve any task work already present in the assigned lane.\",\"campaign\":{\"name\":\"flashnext\",\"repository\":\"mecattaf/flashnext\",\"issue\":{\"number\":\"1\",\"url\":\"local://mecattaf/flashnext/silent-factory-worklists/flashnext.json\"},\"runId\":\"sha256:ac0ef77b2d4a46a6afa4c3d4d139976417738f45445cfdcbe71883417b22482b\"},\"task\":{\"acceptanceCriteria\":[{\"argv\":[\"bash\",\"-euc\",\"bash -n scripts/make-proxy.sh scripts/run-proxy.sh && grep -q 'results/receipts/proxy.json' scripts/run-proxy.sh\"],\"description\":\"Both scripts are syntax-clean and reference the receipt path.\",\"id\":\"proxy-scripts-clean\"}],\"conflictDomains\":[\"scripts/make-proxy.sh\",\"scripts/run-proxy.sh\",\"tests\"],\"deliveredBehaviors\":[\"The admitted kernel path and the ported table path execute on this GPU before any real weight byte is loaded\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"goal\":\"Write scripts/make-proxy.sh and scripts/run-proxy.sh per spec claim 4.1 (specs/flashnext/spec.md#r4). make-proxy.sh runs inside the container and builds a tiny synthetic checkpoint under /var/tmp/flashnext-proxy: the same architecture identifier as the workload, a handful of layers, 8 experts in block-FP8 with weight_block_size 128 by 128, a small lookup table with the shard tensor naming the mmap path expects — reuse the fork's own test scaffolding under tests/models/ inside the fork checkout wherever possible instead of inventing generators. run-proxy.sh serves it single-node from the container with VLLM_PLE_MMAP=1 and eager execution, requests one greedy completion, asserts finite logits via the API, shuts down cleanly, and writes results/receipts/proxy.json. Boundaries: touch only scripts/make-proxy.sh, scripts/run-proxy.sh, and tests/.\",\"id\":\"proxy-tooling\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"readFirst\":{\"specSections\":[\"specs/flashnext/spec.md#r4\",\"specs/flashnext/evidence/ple-54129.md\",\"specs/flashnext/evidence/moe-dispatch.md\"],\"styleReferences\":[\"scripts/run-smoke.sh\"]},\"revision\":\"sha256:e5bea94a618c21673e727d80dc72777cd31604d0c28385bf83f7b349c10d0bfd\",\"title\":\"Proxy checkpoint builder and single-node first-light runner\"},\"workspace\":{\"baseRev\":\"71f2beba0ecd7358eda99e574e078d081f55bbfa\",\"branch\":\"tally-work/flashnext-cac9adc5400c/proxy-tooling\",\"conflictDomains\":[\"scripts/make-proxy.sh\",\"scripts/run-proxy.sh\",\"tests\"],\"publishBranch\":\"tally/flashnext-campaign-01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/proxy-tooling-e5bea94a618c2167\",\"taskId\":\"proxy-tooling\",\"worktreePath\":\"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/cac9adc5400c/proxy-tooling\"},\"steering\":{\"channel\":\"locally-authorized-snapshot\",\"authorizedComments\":[],\"attemptReceipt\":{\"lateRecheckCommentIds\":[],\"preparedCommentIds\":[],\"recheckTruncated\":false,\"rechecked\":true,\"source\":{\"kind\":\"local-jsonl\",\"path\":\"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/steering/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering-v1.jsonl\",\"preparedCursor\":4,\"recheckedCursor\":4,\"registrationId\":\"01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae\"}},\"machineDiagnoses\":[],\"machineOutcomes\":[]}}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787991780427}]}
