{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Wait a sec — template mode: flat cfg, text_config doesn't exist → tc = cfg ✓. But the template's quantization_config goes through the merge ✓ (no existing qc → create a new one with activation_scheme dynamic attached ✓).\n\nBut there's one problem: in template mode, the fields are at the flat top level, and stage_tokenizer reads cfg[\"vocab_size\"] ✓; curated_weights reads things like cfg[\"hidden_size\"] — but in WORKLOAD mode (nested), the curated fallback reads cfg[\"hidden_size\"] → KeyError (this is the crash that occurred). We need a helper that reads geometry from tc. Fix: curated_weights and write_ple_shards and ngram_geometry must use the text_config level. Add a module-level helper `_tc(cfg)` that returns cfg.get(\"text_config\", cfg), and use it in these functions and in main.\n\nAlso ngram_geometry/ngram_row_bytes fix (rows = base//heads; row_bytes = heads×ple_embed_dim). And write_ple_shards: only the ple layers, and use tc.\n\nFurther, the curated writer's prefix: if nested, \"model.language_model\"."}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_be515eca98d14a78a1944483","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/cac9adc5400c/proxy-tooling && python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'scripts/make-proxy.sh'\nsrc = open(p).read()\n\n# --- text_config accessor + geometry fixes ---\nold_geom = src[src.index('def ngram_row_bytes(cfg):'):src.index('def probe_fork_scaffolds():')]\nnew_geom = '''def text_cfg(cfg):\n    \"\"\"Multimodal workload configs nest the language model under text_config;\n    the template config is flat.\"\"\"\n    return cfg.get(\"text_config\", cfg)\n\n\ndef ngram_row_bytes(cfg):\n    \"\"\"Row width of the mmap table, in fp8 elements. The PLE layer builds its\n    embedding at (padded_vocab_size, self.head_dim); the workload arithmetic\n    (specs/flashnext/spec.md \"engram table\": 51.2 B params = 2.5 M rows x\n    20480 B) shows head_dim = heads_per_ngram x ple_embed_dim there.\"\"\"\n    tc = text_cfg(cfg)\n    heads = tc.get(\"heads_per_ngram\")\n    dim = tc.get(\"ple_embed_dim\")\n    if isinstance(heads, int) and isinstance(dim, int):\n        return heads * dim\n    return int(tc.get(\"head_dim\", 256))\n\n\ndef ngram_geometry(cfg):\n    \"\"\"Mirror the loader's shard mapping (specs/flashnext/evidence/\n    ple-54129.md section 3): shard_size = ceil(org / split); the checkpoint\n    carries ceil(org / shard_size) row-block tensors per PLE layer. The row\n    count arithmetic is pinned to the workload's 51.2 B-parameter table:\n    rows = ngram_vocab_size_base // heads_per_ngram, then padded to\n    make_ngram_vocab_size_divisible_by.\"\"\"\n    tc = text_cfg(cfg)\n    base = int(tc.get(\"ngram_vocab_size_base\", 512))\n    heads = int(tc.get(\"heads_per_ngram\", 1))\n    div = int(tc.get(\"make_ngram_vocab_size_divisible_by\", 1) or 1)\n    split = int(tc.get(\"split_ngram_parts\", 512))\n    total = base // heads if heads > 1 and base % heads == 0 else base\n    padded = math.ceil(total / div) * div if div > 1 else total\n    return {\"base\": base, \"heads\": heads, \"divisible_by\": div,\n            \"split\": split, \"rows_total\": padded,\n            \"rows_per_shard\": math.ceil(padded / split) if split else padded,\n            \"note\": \"rows = base // heads per the 51.2B-param arithmetic; \"\n                    \"shard_size mirror of (org + split - 1) // split; a \"\n                    \"mismatch is caught by the discover_shards validation\"}\n\n\n'''\nsrc = src.replace(old_geom, new_geom)\n\n# --- curated_weights: tc-aware + prefix-aware ---\ncw_start = src.index('def curated_weights(cfg):')\ncw_end = src.index('def write_ple_shards(cfg, geom):')\nnew_cw = '''def curated_weights(cfg):\n    \"\"\"qwen3-next-family HF naming; the fallback path. Residual risks, typed:\n    (a) linear-attention and hyperconnection module tensors are left to the\n    fork's own init — safe only when an ignore-list keeps them unquantized;\n    (b) PLE shards are written only for the config's ple_layer_ids.\"\"\"\n    tc = text_cfg(cfg)\n    # Multimodal configs nest weights under model.language_model.\n    prefix = \"model.language_model\" if \"text_config\" in cfg else \"model\"\n    H = int(tc[\"hidden_size\"])\n    HD = int(tc.get(\"head_dim\", 256))\n    NH = int(tc.get(\"num_attention_heads\", 16))\n    NKV = int(tc.get(\"num_key_value_heads\", 2))\n    V = int(tc[\"vocab_size\"])\n    E, M = EXPERTS, int(tc.get(\"moe_intermediate_size\", MOE_INTER))\n    S = int(tc.get(\"shared_expert_intermediate_size\", 0) or 0)\n    quantize_linears = not bool(cfg.get(\"quantization_config\", {})\n                                .get(\"modules_to_not_convert\"))\n    gen = torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED)\n    tensors = {}\n    emb = torch.randn(V, H, generator=gen) * 0.02\n    tensors[f\"{prefix}.embed_tokens.weight\"] = _bf16(emb)\n    tensors[\"lm_head.weight\"] = _bf16(emb)  # tied content keeps logits finite\n    tensors[f\"{prefix}.norm.weight\"] = _bf16(torch.ones(H))\n\n    def linear(name, shape, quantized):\n        if quantized:\n            tensors[name + \".weight\"] = _fp8(torch.zeros(shape))\n            tensors[name + \".weight_scale_inv\"] = _f32(\n                torch.ones(scale_inv_shape(shape)))\n        else:\n            tensors[name + \".weight\"] = _bf16(torch.zeros(shape))\n\n    for i, lt in enumerate(tc[\"layer_types\"]):\n        p = f\"{prefix}.layers.{i}\"\n        tensors[f\"{p}.input_layernorm.weight\"] = _bf16(torch.ones(H))\n        tensors[f\"{p}.post_attention_layernorm.weight\"] = _bf16(torch.ones(H))\n        if lt == \"full_attention\":\n            a = f\"{p}.self_attn\"\n            linear(f\"{a}.q_proj\", (NH * HD, H), quantize_linears)\n            linear(f\"{a}.k_proj\", (NKV * HD, H), quantize_linears)\n            linear(f\"{a}.v_proj\", (NKV * HD, H), quantize_linears)\n            linear(f\"{a}.o_proj\", (H, NH * HD), quantize_linears)\n            tensors[f\"{a}.q_norm.weight\"] = _bf16(torch.ones(HD))\n            tensors[f\"{a}.k_norm.weight\"] = _bf16(torch.ones(HD))\n        # linear_attention layers: no checkpoint tensors are written — the\n        # fork's own init covers them when they stay unquantized (see above).\n        m = f\"{p}.mlp\"\n        # The router is a Linear too: without an ignore list the Fp8 config\n        # would claim it, so its bytes follow the same rule as the linears.\n        linear(f\"{m}.gate\", (E, H), quantize_linears)\n        for e in range(E):\n            for proj, shape in ((\"gate_proj\", (M, H)), (\"up_proj\", (M, H)),\n                                (\"down_proj\", (H, M))):\n                linear(f\"{m}.experts.{e}.{proj}\", shape, True)\n        if S > 0:\n            for proj, shape in ((\"gate_proj\", (S, H)), (\"up_proj\", (S, H)),\n                                (\"down_proj\", (H, S))):\n                linear(f\"{m}.shared_experts.{proj}\", shape, quantize_linears)\n    return tensors\n\n\n'''\nsrc = src[:cw_start] + new_cw + src[cw_end:]\n\n# --- write_ple_shards: only ple layers, tc-aware ---\nws_start = src.index('def write_ple_shards(cfg, geom):')\nws_end = src.index('def validate_ple(ple_mmap, geom):')\nnew_ws = '''def write_ple_shards(cfg, geom):\n    \"\"\"One row-block tensor per shard under the discover_shards naming, plus\n    the per-layer global weight_scale the load_weights interception keeps.\n    Shards are written only for the config's ple_layer_ids. Values are fp8\n    zeros at scale 1.0: the PLE contribution is exactly zero, which is\n    finite by construction.\"\"\"\n    tc = text_cfg(cfg)\n    prefix = \"model.language_model\" if \"text_config\" in cfg else \"model\"\n    rb = ngram_row_bytes(cfg)\n    rows, split = geom[\"rows_per_shard\"], geom[\"split\"]\n    ple_layers = tc.get(\"ple_layer_ids\") or range(int(tc[\"num_hidden_layers\"]))\n    files = 0\n    scale = _f32(torch.ones(1))\n    main = {}\n    for layer in ple_layers:\n        for s in range(split):\n            name = (f\"{prefix}.layers.{layer}.ple.ple_embedding.\"\n                    f\"ngram_embedding.shard_{s:05d}.weight\")\n            save_safetensors(\n                OUT / f\"model-ple-{layer}-{s:05d}.safetensors\",\n                {name: _fp8(torch.zeros(rows, rb))})\n            files += 1\n        main[f\"{prefix}.layers.{layer}.ple.ple_embedding.\"\n             f\"ngram_embedding.weight_scale\"] = scale\n    return files, main\n\n\n'''\nsrc = src[:ws_start] + new_ws + src[ws_end:]\n\n# main(): geometry row_bytes via ngram_row_bytes unchanged; curated writer's\n# quantize_linears now reads the merged qc — also fix the ignore install check\n# and the introspection writer's config reads (nested).\nsrc = src.replace('''        params, _stacked = introspected\n        ignore = sorted({n[:-len(\".weight\")] for n, s in params\n                         if n.endswith(\".weight\") and len(s) >= 1\n                         and \".mlp.experts.\" not in n and \"scale\" not in n})''',\n'''        params, _stacked = introspected\n        ignore = sorted({n[:-len(\".weight\")] for n, s in params\n                         if n.endswith(\".weight\") and len(s) >= 1\n                         and \".mlp.experts.\" not in n and \"scale\" not in n})\n        # lm_head lives at the top level and is never quantized.\n        ignore.append(\"lm_head\")''')\nsrc = src.replace('''        ignore = [r\"(?s)^(?!.*\\\\.mlp\\\\.experts\\\\.).*$\"]''',\n'''        ignore = [r\"(?s)^(?!.*\\\\.mlp\\\\.experts\\\\.).*$\"]''')\nsrc = src.replace('''    if ignore:\n        cfg[\"modules_to_not_convert\"] = ignore''',\n'''    if ignore:\n        cfg[\"quantization_config\"][\"modules_to_not_convert\"] = ignore''')\n# introspection writer config reads -> tc-aware\nsrc = src.replace('''        params, stacked = introspected\n        MANIFEST[\"weight_source\"] = \"fork-introspection\"\n        gen = torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED)\n        H = int(cfg[\"hidden_size\"])\n        HD = int(cfg.get(\"head_dim\", 256))\n        NH = int(cfg.get(\"num_attention_heads\", 16))\n        NKV = int(cfg.get(\"num_key_value_heads\", 2))\n        M = int(cfg.get(\"moe_intermediate_size\", MOE_INTER))\n        E = EXPERTS''',\n'''        params, stacked = introspected\n        MANIFEST[\"weight_source\"] = \"fork-introspection\"\n        gen = torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED)\n        tc = text_cfg(cfg)\n        H = int(tc[\"hidden_size\"])\n        HD = int(tc.get(\"head_dim\", 256))\n        NH = int(tc.get(\"num_attention_heads\", 16))\n        NKV = int(tc.get(\"num_key_value_heads\", 2))\n        M = int(tc.get(\"moe_intermediate_size\", MOE_INTER))\n        E = EXPERTS''')\nsrc = src.replace('''    manifest_path = OUT / \"proxy-manifest.json\"''',\n'''    MANIFEST[\"geometry\"][\"ple_layers\"] = list(\n        text_cfg(cfg).get(\"ple_layer_ids\", range(LAYERS)))\n    manifest_path = OUT / \"proxy-manifest.json\"''')\nopen(p, 'w').write(src)\nEOF\nbash -n scripts/make-proxy.sh && awk '/<<.PY.$/{f=1;next} /^PY$/{f=0} f' scripts/make-proxy.sh > /tmp/mp.py && python3 -m py_compile /tmp/mp.py && echo OK"}}}}
