ns the packed has 3 entries; sizes will probably be [320, 16] + padding…\n\nBetter approach: try alternative attributes: the module might be exposing `output_sizes`. First, probe the actual attribute of the module in the container — a quick one-shot: reproduce introspection and print dir(module) for in_proj_ba. That's another full build (~30 seconds). Worth doing."}}
